  "duration": 68.30999755859375,
  "text": "Every wedding venue wants more enquiries. But that's not where most bookings are won or lost. They're won in the moments after a couple gets in touch. The problem is that most venues are leaking opportunities every single day. 81% of couples say they've felt frustrated by venue response times. Two-thirds visit three venues or fewer before making a decision. And almost 70% of wedding enquiries happen outside normal office hours. A couple visits your website, requests a brochure, books a tour, asks a question, waits for a reply. And every one of those moments either moves them closer to booking or closer to your competitor. Most venues don't have an enquiry problem. They have a conversion problem. Opportunities are missed, follow-ups don't happen, teams get busy and couples quietly disappear. That's exactly why we built VenueBot.",
